[{"@context":"http:\/\/schema.org","@type":"LocalBusiness","logo":"https:\/\/cdn0.bodas.net\/vendor\/78656\/3_2\/960\/jpg\/ninos-de-boda-logotipo_1_78656.webp","url":"https:\/\/www.bodas.net\/vestidos-de-arras\/ninos-de-boda--e78656","name":"Ni\u00f1os de Boda","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","postalCode":"03110","addressLocality":"Alacant\/alicante","addressRegion":"Alicante","streetAddress":"C\/ Escorpio n\u00ba 1 Local 8 Centro Comercial La Almajada, Mutxamel, Alicante"},"geo":{"@type":"GeoCoordinates","latitude":38.40310000000000201225702767260372638702392578125,"longitude":-0.45923999999999998156141600702540017664432525634765625},"aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","reviewCount":5,"ratingValue":"5.0","worstRating":0,"bestRating":5},"image":[{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/cdn0.bodas.net\/vendor\/78656\/3_2\/960\/jpg\/img-5040_1_78656.webp","width":960,"height":640},{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/cdn0.bodas.net\/vendor\/78656\/3_2\/960\/jpg\/vestido-nathalie-estampado_1_78656.webp","width":960,"height":640},{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/cdn0.bodas.net\/vendor\/78656\/3_2\/960\/jpg\/vestido-grace-de-tul-bordado-en-seda_1_78656.webp","width":960,"height":640},{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/cdn0.bodas.net\/vendor\/78656\/3_2\/960\/jpg\/vestido-rita-flus-flus_1_78656.webp","width":960,"height":640},{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/cdn0.bodas.net\/vendor\/78656\/3_2\/960\/jpg\/vestido-mariela_1_78656.webp","width":960,"height":640},{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/cdn0.bodas.net\/vendor\/78656\/3_2\/960\/jpg\/espardena-personalizada-vega_1_78656.webp","width":960,"height":640},{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/cdn0.bodas.net\/vendor\/78656\/3_2\/960\/jpg\/conjunto-de-pantalon-rodrigo-y-camisa-ibiza_1_78656.webp","width":960,"height":640},{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/cdn0.bodas.net\/vendor\/78656\/3_2\/960\/jpg\/conjunto-toba-bebe_1_78656.webp","width":960,"height":640},{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/cdn0.bodas.net\/vendor\/78656\/3_2\/960\/jpg\/conjunto-tiroles-valenciene_1_78656.webp","width":960,"height":640},{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/cdn0.bodas.net\/vendor\/78656\/3_2\/960\/jpg\/vestido-arras-toba_1_78656.webp","width":960,"height":640},{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/cdn0.bodas.net\/vendor\/78656\/3_2\/960\/jpg\/conjunto-nino-quemono_1_78656.webp","width":960,"height":640},{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/cdn0.bodas.net\/vendor\/78656\/3_2\/960\/jpg\/img-5000-3_1_78656.webp","width":960,"height":640},{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/cdn0.bodas.net\/vendor\/78656\/3_2\/960\/jpg\/img-6277-2_1_78656.webp","width":960,"height":640}],"review":[{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2018-09-18","description":"Fui con mi hijo de dos a\u00f1os, un torbellino, y tuvo una paciencia con nosotros y sobre todo con \u00e9l. \u00a1Muchas gracias y, sobre todo, por la pajarita de mis ni\u00f1os que iban preciosos!","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Nuria"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5.0","bestRating":5,"worstRating":0}},{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2017-03-22","description":"Por circunstancias fuimos con muy poco tiempo. En ning\u00fan momento nos puso ning\u00fan problema, todo era \u00e1nimo, amor y un trato muy familiar. Los vestidos que fueron 3 cada uno a nuestra manera y hay mucha profesionalidad. A mi hija mayor la hizo muy feliz con sus consejos.","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Vanesa"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5.0","bestRating":5,"worstRating":0}},{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2016-11-01","description":"Cuando fui a Ni\u00f1os de Boda, no tenia muy claro lo que buscaba (sab\u00eda qu\u00e9 no quer\u00eda, eso s\u00ed) y M\u00f3nica capt\u00f3 enseguida mi idea y mi 'rollo'. Prob\u00f3 con mi hijo un traje... \u00a1Espectacular! Y despu\u00e9s de ese momento no me lo imagin\u00e9 con nada m\u00e1s. \u00a1Muy recomendable y fue mi principito encantador!","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Marina"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5.0","bestRating":5,"worstRating":0}},{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2016-10-20","description":"Gracias a Monica, que es la persona con m\u00e1s gusto y empat\u00eda que pude elegir, mi boda fue ESPECTACULAR. Sus ganas de que todo saliera perfecto, me dieron paz. En sus manos pude so\u00f1ar con el d\u00eda de mi boda.","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Pen\u00e9lope"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5.0","bestRating":5,"worstRating":0}},{"@type":"Review","datePublished":"2016-09-03","description":"\u00a1Mi hija est\u00e1 encantada con el vestido! Acertamos en pleno con Ni\u00f1os de boda porque personalizamos el modelo que m\u00e1s le gust\u00f3. Adem\u00e1s, el trato recibido fue fant\u00e1stico, M\u00f3nica tiene mucho gusto y mano con los ni\u00f1os.","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"M Cruz"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5.0","bestRating":5,"worstRating":0}}]}]            </script>
